 "protocol": "Noise-matched DS1 out-of-fold comparison: CNN (12 existing surrogate checkpoints) vs random forest trained with the\nSAME corruption augmentation as the CNN. Run from the pinned repo directory (cwd=/content/pg_pinned_v1) with\nds1_tree_baseline.py in the same folder as this file or on sys.path. DS2 is never opened. Protocol fixed before running:\n  RF training set = clean beats + one fully-corrupted copy (CNN marginal: p=0.5), CorruptionAugment(max_severity 0.6,\n  p_real_noise 0.4, NSTDB FIRST half), channel 0 only, diff channel recomputed, features recomputed.\n  Evaluation = identical corrupted held-out beats for every model; real noise from the NSTDB SECOND half.\n  Models: CNN (4 folds x 3 seeds), RF-clean (trained clean), RF-aug (trained with augmentation).\nMetric: N/S/V mean of per-class F1 from pooled confusion (F/Q beats count as errors).",
